<!-- Pain points -->
<section class="bg-canvas py-20 px-6 md:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-serif font-normal text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.15] mb-4 text-ink max-w-xl">The questions nobody asks, until they have to.</h2>
    <p class="text-dim text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed opacity-70 max-w-xl mb-12">Most families only discover what's missing when something has already gone wrong. A little organising now means fewer scrambles later.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "lock", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">"Where do they keep the originals?"</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Property papers, FDs and insurance policies, scattered across drawers, lockers and old files.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "triangle-alert", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">"Who's named as nominee?"</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed"><a href="https://chambers.com/articles/nominee-vs-legal-successor-does-nomination-mean-ownership" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-saffron hover:text-saffron-deep transition-colors">The Supreme Court has held that nominees on bank accounts and mutual funds are custodians, not owners</a>. Without a will, even a named nominee may not inherit.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "users", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">"Who do they call for help?"</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Doctor, CA, lawyer, insurance agent: the people your parents rely on, written down somewhere the whole family can find.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "share-2", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">"What happens to the rest?"</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed"><a href="https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2244475&reg=3&lang=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-saffron hover:text-saffron-deep transition-colors">&#8377;73,000 crore sits unclaimed</a> in Indian bank deposits, insurance and mutual funds, simply because nobody knew it existed.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How Collator helps -->
<section class="bg-tint border-y border-hair py-20 px-6 md:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-serif font-normal text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.15] mb-12 text-ink">How Collator helps</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">Start with what exists</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">No need to plan for every scenario today. Just record the documents, policies and accounts your parents already have. The picture builds itself over time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">A gentle, ongoing project</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Add a little at a time, on visits home or over a weekend. There's no deadline, and nothing to get wrong.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">Surfaces the gaps quietly</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Collator highlights where a nominee is missing or a will isn't linked, so the family can close those gaps before they matter.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">Stays theirs</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Your parents' vault lives on their device. No account, no cloud, nothing shared unless they choose to share it.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

